# A bar chart whose series stand side by side shares each category's bar room among them: slot i of k (the members'
# own bars are slot 0) is centred at off + 2 h i from the category's centre.
@shp.bs.c ui.diagram.chart group=?g form=bar
@shp.bs.n ui.diagram.sers group=?g count=?sk
@shp.bs.m ui.diagram.cstack group=?g mode=none
