# Each value's segment along the value axis (from, to) and its centre across: side by side from the floor, in its slot;
# stacked between the running totals; as shares between the running totals over the category's total.
@shp.sg.d ui.diagram.dpos datum=?d node=?c group=?g r=?r v=?v
@shp.sg.x ui.diagram.catx node=?c x=?cx
@shp.sg.bs ui.diagram.bslot group=?g h=?h off=?off
